    "campaign": {
     "title": "Agency 1: Your agency tools are on",
     "email_subject": "Your agency tools are on",
     "email_pre_header": "Keep each client's licenses in one place, and let clients pay their own renewals.",
     "email_body": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"primary\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":881668,\"width\":\"200px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/account/agency/\"><img src=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/logo-5.png\" alt=\"GravityKit\" class=\"wp-image-881668\" style=\"width:200px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"filter-md\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-filter-md-font-size\">Hi {{contact.first_name|there}},</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your GravityKit account is now set up for an agency. That means you can:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Add your clients</strong>, so each one has an account with you as their agency.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Assign licenses to clients.</strong> They can download the plugins and see their licenses, and you still own and pay for them.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Email a client a payment link</strong> when a license is due, so they pay the renewal themselves. They don't need an account or your password.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Two minutes to start: give your agency the name your clients know. It signs every email we send them for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#1877f2\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/account/agency/settings\" style=\"background-color:#1877f2\">Name My Agency</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you assign your first license to a client, we'll send you a $100 code toward your next license.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Questions? Just reply. I read every email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zack Katz<br>Founder, GravityKit</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
