    "campaign": {
     "title": "Agency 3: Assign a license",
     "email_subject": "Assign a license to your client, get $100 off your next one",
     "email_pre_header": "Your client can download the plugins. You keep the license.",
     "email_body": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"primary\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":881668,\"width\":\"200px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/account/agency/licenses\"><img src=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/logo-5.png\" alt=\"GravityKit\" class=\"wp-image-881668\" style=\"width:200px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"filter-md\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-filter-md-font-size\">Hi {{contact.first_name|there}},</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You've added a client. Next, assign them a license:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Open <strong>Agency &gt; Licenses</strong>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pick a license and choose <strong>Assign to a client</strong>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#1877f2\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/account/agency/licenses\" style=\"background-color:#1877f2\">Assign a License</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your client can then download the plugins and see the license in their own account. You still own it, pay for it, and can take it back at any time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you've assigned your first license, we'll email you a $100 code toward your next license.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zack Katz<br>Founder, GravityKit</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
